(1812870, 249406, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love the title and the little one''s expression.  It seems a tad busy to me with the textured seat and the dog and the various textures on the skirt. Adorable child.  The lack of light on the face leaves it a bit flat.  I think I''d take the dog away, and crop just below her hands and make it more of a portrait of a pout. hee hee</td>', 'Love the title and the little one''s expression.  It seems a tad busy to me with the textured seat and the dog and the various textures on the skirt. Adorable child.  The lack of light on the face leaves it a bit flat.  I think I''d take the dog away, and crop just below her hands and make it more of a portrait of a pout. hee hee', '2005-10-26 01:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
