(1814144, 248106, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has no visual appeal whatsoever.  It isn''t tack sharp, the cup is dead centered like a target and the background doesn''t appear that white.  Maybe take an interesting piece of stemware, place it to one side using the rule of thirds, have a really focused image and go from there. To clean up the beigy tones of the background, use a selective color adjustment and remove the black, cyan, magenta and yellow.</td>', 'This has no visual appeal whatsoever.  It isn''t tack sharp, the cup is dead centered like a target and the background doesn''t appear that white.  Maybe take an interesting piece of stemware, place it to one side using the rule of thirds, have a really focused image and go from there. To clean up the beigy tones of the background, use a selective color adjustment and remove the black, cyan, magenta and yellow.', '2005-10-26 11:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1814153, 249416, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this.  I think it lacks tack sharp focus, which hurts it.  If the rose were a really pale pink, I think the challenge would have been served better. The composition is decent.  Maybe have her holding the rose, down in front of her, so that there is more negative space to the right. The lighting is right.</td>', 'I like the idea of this.  I think it lacks tack sharp focus, which hurts it.  If the rose were a really pale pink, I think the challenge would have been served better. The composition is decent.  Maybe have her holding the rose, down in front of her, so that there is more negative space to the right. The lighting is right.', '2005-10-26 11:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
