(1814179, 247198, 15711, '<td valign="top">This just doesn''t have any visual appeal.  Just a bunch of buttons piled on a blanket or something.  For this to be artful, it needs something to make the viewer want to spend more time. Maybe a single pale pink button on a solid flat, untextured background with perhaps a need threaded with pale pink thread (or blue, or whatever) leading up to it, with lots of negative space....  Just a thought.</td>', 'This just doesn''t have any visual appeal.  Just a bunch of buttons piled on a blanket or something.  For this to be artful, it needs something to make the viewer want to spend more time. Maybe a single pale pink button on a solid flat, untextured background with perhaps a need threaded with pale pink thread (or blue, or whatever) leading up to it, with lots of negative space....  Just a thought.', '2005-10-26 11:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
