(1814222, 248997, 15711, '<td valign="top">Clever and interesting.  I''d like more negative space to one side, so that the glass and fish aren''t bullseye target centered. Great execution of an action shot.  The background has pale pink and blue striations - maybe it''s my monitor.</td>', 'Clever and interesting.  I''d like more negative space to one side, so that the glass and fish aren''t bullseye target centered. Great execution of an action shot.  The background has pale pink and blue striations - maybe it''s my monitor.', '2005-10-26 11:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
