(1815492, 249520, 29490, '<td valign="top">I recognize this woman, very familiar ... hmmmmm.<br/> <br/>Very nice Cindi, great lighting, nice shadows; light, white, light on white, the works.  Good crop, good focus, nice dof.  Definitely a "good job".  I''m easy so I''ll give -2 for spite.  This is my first vote but w/o looking at the others will say this is definitely top 20 or higher.</td>', 'I recognize this woman, very familiar ... hmmmmm. Very nice Cindi, great lighting, nice shadows; light, white, light on white, the works.  Good crop, good focus, nice dof.  Definitely a "good job".  I''m easy so I''ll give -2 for spite.  This is my first vote but w/o looking at the others will say this is definitely top 20 or higher.', '2005-10-26 17:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1815502, 248909, 17507, '<td valign="top">this picture is really interesting to me. looking at it from the standpoint of a portrait, one might say that the strong vertical lines in the background are hopelessly distracting from the model - but I think this is merely the wrong way to look at this. Because the lines are such a strong design element, they almost become more the subject than the girl herself, which creates a very graphic-design feel to it. the background vibrates with the foreground and flattens it in a way, which leaves the whole photo as the "subject" without any real "background" elements. <br/> <br/>nice work :)</td>', 'this picture is really interesting to me. looking at it from the standpoint of a portrait, one might say that the strong vertical lines in the background are hopelessly distracting from the model - but I think this is merely the wrong way to look at this. Because the lines are such a strong design element, they almost become more the subject than the girl herself, which creates a very graphic-design feel to it. the background vibrates with the foreground and flattens it in a way, which leaves the whole photo as the "subject" without any real "background" elements.  nice work :)', '2005-10-26 17:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
