(1815696, 249584, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very  pretty. Love the detail of the rose.  The background variation is a tad distracting, with all of the layers of the petals already having a busy sense to them. Maybe zoom in further and just have a hint of the background, in order to meet the challenge. OR put the rose way off center, with lots of negative space to one side.  I''d actually love to see it cropped, with no background at all, but that''s another challenge altogether. LOL</td>', 'Very  pretty. Love the detail of the rose.  The background variation is a tad distracting, with all of the layers of the petals already having a busy sense to them. Maybe zoom in further and just have a hint of the background, in order to meet the challenge. OR put the rose way off center, with lots of negative space to one side.  I''d actually love to see it cropped, with no background at all, but that''s another challenge altogether. LOL', '2005-10-26 17:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1815720, 249537, 33145, '<td valign="top">I marked this down for the following reasons: the background is grey, a simple curves adjustment could have whitened it up; you''ve cropped all three major elements of the shot;  you have submitted a shot smaller than the maximum allowable size (640x640); and there is too much (flash?) shadow cast. Being mindfull of these things would see you future challenges do much better. I  gave you good marks for image clarity and sharpness and meeting the challenge. Good luck!</td>', 'I marked this down for the following reasons: the background is grey, a simple curves adjustment could have whitened it up; you''ve cropped all three major elements of the shot;  you have submitted a shot smaller than the maximum allowable size (640x640); and there is too much (flash?) shadow cast. Being mindfull of these things would see you future challenges do much better. I  gave you good marks for image clarity and sharpness and meeting the challenge. Good luck!', '2005-10-26 18:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
