(1816025, 249370, 11923, '<td valign="top">Tsk.<br/> <br/>That said.  Certainly meets the challenge.  The composition is a little.. ah.. boring, but it does the job!  Good lighting, good clarity.  Looks like you might have some compression artifacts but I had that problem too so I feel your pain.  A very serviceable image.  I gave a 6.</td>', 'Tsk. That said.  Certainly meets the challenge.  The composition is a little.. ah.. boring, but it does the job!  Good lighting, good clarity.  Looks like you might have some compression artifacts but I had that problem too so I feel your pain.  A very serviceable image.  I gave a 6.', '2005-10-26 20:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1816029, 248148, 31443, '<td valign="top">What beautiful eyes, ok, so I''m biased when it comes to the kitties, nice shot..</td>', 'What beautiful eyes, ok, so I''m biased when it comes to the kitties, nice shot..', '2005-10-26 20:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1816032, 247357, 11923, '<td valign="top">Interesting image, it is very dynamic.  I''m having to stretch to make it meet challenge, simply because though it is lighter than some things, it is still fairly dark in comparison to the white background - the wisher things have a very brown tinge in much of the image.  I don''t know if this is an effect of the lighting used or not as there do appear to be some lighter colored ones.  The focus is a bit problematic for me because my eyes are being drawn to the foremost wisher and it is very fuzzy, whereas some of the puffs in the clump further back have better defined features.  I like your composition, it looks good tucked in the corner and your border is simple and doesn''t hamper the image at all.  Lighting looks good.  I gave a 5.</td>', 'Interesting image, it is very dynamic.  I''m having to stretch to make it meet challenge, simply because though it is lighter than some things, it is still fairly dark in comparison to the white background - the wisher things have a very brown tinge in much of the image.  I don''t know if this is an effect of the lighting used or not as there do appear to be some lighter colored ones.  The focus is a bit problematic for me because my eyes are being drawn to the foremost wisher and it is very fuzzy, whereas some of the puffs in the clump further back have better defined features.  I like your composition, it looks good tucked in the corner and your border is simple and doesn''t hamper the image at all.  Lighting looks good.  I gave a 5.', '2005-10-26 20:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1816038, 247866, 42005, '<td valign="top">This is marvelous. I hope you consider selling this as a print! 9</td>', 'This is marvelous. I hope you consider selling this as a print! 9', '2005-10-26 20:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1816040, 249403, 33068, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and texture.</td>', 'Nice composition and texture.', '2005-10-26 20:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1816042, 248438, 11923, '<td valign="top">Wow what wonderful eyes indeed.   Definitely meets the challenge.  This is a great way to highlight those eyes too as they certainly stand out in the sea of white.   The lighting looks okay but there are some blown out whites above the cat''s head and some details of the fur seem to be lost - though whether this is due to focus issues, lighting or compression problems, I can''t tell.  I think the composition is good, I''m not sure if it would be even more dramatic if the cat was looking directly at the camera or not.. working with animals is never easy though.<br/> <br/>All in all a great entry.  I wish there was a bit more detail in the fur, but over all good job.  I gave a 6</td>', 'Wow what wonderful eyes indeed.   Definitely meets the challenge.  This is a great way to highlight those eyes too as they certainly stand out in the sea of white.   The lighting looks okay but there are some blown out whites above the cat''s head and some details of the fur seem to be lost - though whether this is due to focus issues, lighting or compression problems, I can''t tell.  I think the composition is good, I''m not sure if it would be even more dramatic if the cat was looking directly at the camera or not.. working with animals is never easy though. All in all a great entry.  I wish there was a bit more detail in the fur, but over all good job.  I gave a 6', '2005-10-26 20:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1816043, 249266, 43031, '<td valign="top">what?</td>', 'what?', '2005-10-26 20:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1816044, 248931, 42005, '<td valign="top">Maxx is just wonderful.  Everything about this photograph is delightful.<br/>Will be interested in reading about how you did it. Give him pats from NYC.<br/>9</td>', 'Maxx is just wonderful.  Everything about this photograph is delightful.Will be interested in reading about how you did it. Give him pats from NYC.9', '2005-10-26 20:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1816046, 249298, 42005, '<td valign="top">Very delightful.  Thoughtful idea and marvelous shadowing  - use of light.<br/>Thank you for sharing!</td>', 'Very delightful.  Thoughtful idea and marvelous shadowing  - use of light.Thank you for sharing!', '2005-10-26 20:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1816048, 248766, 33068, '<td valign="top">The subject is centered.  I think a different placement would have made the composition a little more pleasing.</td>', 'The subject is centered.  I think a different placement would have made the composition a little more pleasing.', '2005-10-26 20:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1816053, 247614, 33068, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition, texture, and light.  Maybe a little sharper focus on the ring would have helped.  Not sure though.</td>', 'Beautiful composition, texture, and light.  Maybe a little sharper focus on the ring would have helped.  Not sure though.', '2005-10-26 20:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1816057, 248396, 33068, '<td valign="top">Very creative.  It has an abstract feel to it which I love. I would have liked to seen a brighter white perhaps.</td>', 'Very creative.  It has an abstract feel to it which I love. I would have liked to seen a brighter white perhaps.', '2005-10-26 20:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1816058, 247835, 42005, '<td valign="top">Quite delightful.  It took me a minute to see it.   Love the starkness....the<br/>pureness of the shell...the light shadowing.....lovely.</td>', 'Quite delightful.  It took me a minute to see it.   Love the starkness....thepureness of the shell...the light shadowing.....lovely.', '2005-10-26 20:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1816062, 247352, 11923, '<td valign="top">I can see where you were going with this, but it doesn''t seem to meet the challenge to me, mostly because there is a whole lot of color being shown for a challenge focusing on light on white.   The lighting is okay, but the composition and subject doesn''t grab my interest at all.  The hand holding the item up is very distracting as is the blue sky behind it.  The focus looks good.  Had the shot simply been of the white item on the bark of the beech? tree, I could see it tie in with the challenge much more.  I gave a 3.</td>', 'I can see where you were going with this, but it doesn''t seem to meet the challenge to me, mostly because there is a whole lot of color being shown for a challenge focusing on light on white.   The lighting is okay, but the composition and subject doesn''t grab my interest at all.  The hand holding the item up is very distracting as is the blue sky behind it.  The focus looks good.  Had the shot simply been of the white item on the bark of the beech? tree, I could see it tie in with the challenge much more.  I gave a 3.', '2005-10-26 20:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1816063, 249417, 33068, '<td valign="top">Great portrait.  Nice white and pink combination.  Well done!</td>', 'Great portrait.  Nice white and pink combination.  Well done!', '2005-10-26 20:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1816066, 247384, 11923, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  I love the gliding feeling the image has.  Certainly meets the challenge and the lighting/composition is very good.  Looks like you picked up some good details in the wings/feathers too.  Well done.  I gave a 6.</td>', 'Very nice!  I love the gliding feeling the image has.  Certainly meets the challenge and the lighting/composition is very good.  Looks like you picked up some good details in the wings/feathers too.  Well done.  I gave a 6.', '2005-10-26 20:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1816067, 248294, 33068, '<td valign="top">I like the DOF in this picture and the simple composotion.    The whites are a little gray in my opinion though.  Nice job however.</td>', 'I like the DOF in this picture and the simple composotion.    The whites are a little gray in my opinion though.  Nice job however.', '2005-10-26 20:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1816072, 247402, 33068, '<td valign="top">LIke the soft peach color.  However, the yellow bled into the white areas a little.</td>', 'LIke the soft peach color.  However, the yellow bled into the white areas a little.', '2005-10-26 20:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1816076, 249188, 11923, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if this is really light on white, as the yellow is very very vibrant rather than light.  But.. it is lighter than the orange that giraffes normally are.   I like the composition with the giraffe peeking from the side but the image is unappealing to me in general.  Probably because of how bizarrely colored the giraffe is with no context to give it a reason why it is that color.  I gave a 4.</td>', 'I''m not sure if this is really light on white, as the yellow is very very vibrant rather than light.  But.. it is lighter than the orange that giraffes normally are.   I like the composition with the giraffe peeking from the side but the image is unappealing to me in general.  Probably because of how bizarrely colored the giraffe is with no context to give it a reason why it is that color.  I gave a 4.', '2005-10-26 20:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1816083, 249520, 29906, '<td valign="top">This one immediately catches the eye, very good, 10</td>', 'This one immediately catches the eye, very good, 10', '2005-10-26 20:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
