(1817332, 247926, 40295, '<td valign="top">While I know you did it to light the piece better, I don''t care a lot for the double shadow. A softer light migh have worked better for me - or more overhead light  to kill the shadows.</td>', 'While I know you did it to light the piece better, I don''t care a lot for the double shadow. A softer light migh have worked better for me - or more overhead light  to kill the shadows.', '2005-10-27 07:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
