(1818986, 249043, 20075, '<td valign="top">Great concept!  Too bad it''s the basic editing challenge - it would look even better if you could have gotten rid of that text around the center and the line in the background.  Is that a sheet of paper?  I found that "Magic tape" works fairly well in hiding lines like that.  Not perfect, but better than nothing.</td>', 'Great concept!  Too bad it''s the basic editing challenge - it would look even better if you could have gotten rid of that text around the center and the line in the background.  Is that a sheet of paper?  I found that "Magic tape" works fairly well in hiding lines like that.  Not perfect, but better than nothing.', '2005-10-27 19:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1818987, 247705, 45857, '<td valign="top">Light On White, I not sure you have the idea here, but it is a good astronomical shot. So many people have the idea you can get a good image of the full, but if you think about it its just like ''good'' light on earth, you don''t get it at noon. Its much better to shoot half moon and paste them together.</td>', 'Light On White, I not sure you have the idea here, but it is a good astronomical shot. So many people have the idea you can get a good image of the full, but if you think about it its just like ''good'' light on earth, you don''t get it at noon. Its much better to shoot half moon and paste them together.', '2005-10-27 19:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1818990, 248986, 20075, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice shot.  I like your use of the step as a leading line into the photo, and the *really* white flower on top.  I think it would have been even better if your background didn''t have a texture like that.  Something smooth (but not shiny) may have been better.</td>', 'This is a really nice shot.  I like your use of the step as a leading line into the photo, and the *really* white flower on top.  I think it would have been even better if your background didn''t have a texture like that.  Something smooth (but not shiny) may have been better.', '2005-10-27 19:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
