(1820294, 249461, 16106, '<td valign="top">what ever that gunk is on the right of the ball, it sure hurts the shot. well framed and the lighting is perfect, but my eye just loops back to the left, is it dirt, is it some odd logo? of course most of the shots in this challenge have a flaw or two is it might fly yet .</td>', 'what ever that gunk is on the right of the ball, it sure hurts the shot. well framed and the lighting is perfect, but my eye just loops back to the left, is it dirt, is it some odd logo? of course most of the shots in this challenge have a flaw or two is it might fly yet .', '2005-10-28 05:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
