(1820534, 249547, 39664, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but this doesn''t look real at all.  The eagle appears to be something hanging in the background and the eggs are chicken eggs in paper from your shredder with a few springs of grass.  The background is so blurry that is doesn''t even count as soft focus (probably to hide your fake eagle) and it is all very 1-dimensional where as it looks like you attempted to make it have a shallow DOF for depth.  This all may sound harsh but this is what I see and what I don''t care for in your photo.  Your idea was a neat one but your technical execution was poor. Feel free to send me a message.</td>', 'Sorry, but this doesn''t look real at all.  The eagle appears to be something hanging in the background and the eggs are chicken eggs in paper from your shredder with a few springs of grass.  The background is so blurry that is doesn''t even count as soft focus (probably to hide your fake eagle) and it is all very 1-dimensional where as it looks like you attempted to make it have a shallow DOF for depth.  This all may sound harsh but this is what I see and what I don''t care for in your photo.  Your idea was a neat one but your technical execution was poor. Feel free to send me a message.', '2005-10-28 09:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
