(1821288, 248976, 46706, '<td valign="top">I like this one a lot but I think the background should have been lighter, ie more white than gray. having it gray made it easy not to blow it out, which is what this exercise is about I presume.</td>', 'I like this one a lot but I think the background should have been lighter, ie more white than gray. having it gray made it easy not to blow it out, which is what this exercise is about I presume.', '2005-10-28 15:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
