(1821318, 248994, 46706, '<td valign="top">like this idea, but I think the leaves are too bright. my eyes aren''t liking the hue. I think if the leaves had been more golden and had shown more vein detail it would have been amazing.</td>', 'like this idea, but I think the leaves are too bright. my eyes aren''t liking the hue. I think if the leaves had been more golden and had shown more vein detail it would have been amazing.', '2005-10-28 15:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
