(1821333, 247302, 46706, '<td valign="top">don''t like the slight blur I''m seeing on this photo. I think the swans should have been sharper; it''s not like the move that fast. If the focus is sharp, then the contrast is what my eyes aren''t adjusting to.</td>', 'don''t like the slight blur I''m seeing on this photo. I think the swans should have been sharper; it''s not like the move that fast. If the focus is sharp, then the contrast is what my eyes aren''t adjusting to.', '2005-10-28 15:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821334, 249200, 46706, '<td valign="top">Poor quality, bad focus for an easy shot like this.</td>', 'Poor quality, bad focus for an easy shot like this.', '2005-10-28 15:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821336, 248915, 44268, '<td valign="top">I find it kind of odd that the focus is on the knight to the left. Focusing on either the foremost piece (the bishop) or the farthest piece from the camera (the king) would make more sense to me.</td>', 'I find it kind of odd that the focus is on the knight to the left. Focusing on either the foremost piece (the bishop) or the farthest piece from the camera (the king) would make more sense to me.', '2005-10-28 15:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821340, 247908, 46706, '<td valign="top">I like the light balance on this very much. the only reason I wouldn''t buy it for myself is cause I don''t like the little bit of sunlight on the ear and nose. I think it''s just a bit too bright and distracts from the overall quality of the pic. I''ll still give it a high score, though.</td>', 'I like the light balance on this very much. the only reason I wouldn''t buy it for myself is cause I don''t like the little bit of sunlight on the ear and nose. I think it''s just a bit too bright and distracts from the overall quality of the pic. I''ll still give it a high score, though.', '2005-10-28 15:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821341, 248804, 46706, '<td valign="top">way too bright for my eyes.</td>', 'way too bright for my eyes.', '2005-10-28 15:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821342, 249597, 46706, '<td valign="top">I like this very much because it''s pleasing to the eye and has a "warmth" and "glow" to it that I haven''t felt in any others so far.</td>', 'I like this very much because it''s pleasing to the eye and has a "warmth" and "glow" to it that I haven''t felt in any others so far.', '2005-10-28 15:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
