(1821880, 247866, 30881, '<td valign="top">I think the bear itself is excellent!  I think the back wall might have looded better more heavily blurred? It seems too distracting. Overall you captured a wonderful mood. Well done</td>', 'I think the bear itself is excellent!  I think the back wall might have looded better more heavily blurred? It seems too distracting. Overall you captured a wonderful mood. Well done', '2005-10-28 20:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821881, 247908, 40797, '<td valign="top">What a sweet beautiful looking horse. I love his brown ear, his pink nose, and his red bridle. This horse''s eyes express so much kindness. There is such a gentleness about him. He does look very regal against the cream colored wall or barn.  I love your your choice of subject, the clairity and  sharpness of this photo. Excellent Job! 10</td>', 'What a sweet beautiful looking horse. I love his brown ear, his pink nose, and his red bridle. This horse''s eyes express so much kindness. There is such a gentleness about him. He does look very regal against the cream colored wall or barn.  I love your your choice of subject, the clairity and  sharpness of this photo. Excellent Job! 10', '2005-10-28 20:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821883, 249073, 30881, '<td valign="top">Great title. It has a very soft heavenly feel to it. Really like the very heavy blur on second flower in background. Hopefully it will finish high</td>', 'Great title. It has a very soft heavenly feel to it. Really like the very heavy blur on second flower in background. Hopefully it will finish high', '2005-10-28 20:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821889, 249207, 30881, '<td valign="top">If I were to get very picky there are a few minor things that I would personally like to see changed but this is your image and overall it  is well done and deserves a high finish My compliments</td>', 'If I were to get very picky there are a few minor things that I would personally like to see changed but this is your image and overall it  is well done and deserves a high finish My compliments', '2005-10-28 20:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821895, 249416, 30881, '<td valign="top">You chose a beautiful model. and I really like the lighting on her hair. Very nice portrait.<br/>The dark shadow upper left behind her head would have been nicer as white without the smudgy feel it now has. Otherwise I think this is excellent work and deserves a very high finish</td>', 'You chose a beautiful model. and I really like the lighting on her hair. Very nice portrait.The dark shadow upper left behind her head would have been nicer as white without the smudgy feel it now has. Otherwise I think this is excellent work and deserves a very high finish', '2005-10-28 20:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821900, 249022, 30881, '<td valign="top">Great idea and followthrough. Certainly has light on white. Some people may not care for the washed out eye, a bit more green would have really improved this image. However overall I really like the results you achieved. Good work</td>', 'Great idea and followthrough. Certainly has light on white. Some people may not care for the washed out eye, a bit more green would have really improved this image. However overall I really like the results you achieved. Good work', '2005-10-28 20:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821905, 247034, 30881, '<td valign="top">Like the color you kept in the face while allowing the chest and legs to dissolve into the white light. Good job. Congrats.</td>', 'Like the color you kept in the face while allowing the chest and legs to dissolve into the white light. Good job. Congrats.', '2005-10-28 20:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821919, 248804, 30881, '<td valign="top">Everything in the image is soft and subtle feeling. The only thing I would have liked to see is the wine glass stem cropped out of the image about half way down. The long stem and base take the eye too far downward from the flowers. Otherwise this is excellent photography.</td>', 'Everything in the image is soft and subtle feeling. The only thing I would have liked to see is the wine glass stem cropped out of the image about half way down. The long stem and base take the eye too far downward from the flowers. Otherwise this is excellent photography.', '2005-10-28 20:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
