(1821952, 249547, 41675, '<td valign="top">Wow - similar to my shot -- eek -- lol. I like the blurred eagle swooping in from the background. Nice added touch with the bit of brances too.</td>', 'Wow - similar to my shot -- eek -- lol. I like the blurred eagle swooping in from the background. Nice added touch with the bit of brances too.', '2005-10-28 21:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
