(1821962, 249418, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and I like the coloring too. I want to gently remove the little spider off the foreground rose as I find him distracting, but it was probably his home and he was there first. :-) Nice shot - good luck in the challenge. 9</td>', 'Nice composition and I like the coloring too. I want to gently remove the little spider off the foreground rose as I find him distracting, but it was probably his home and he was there first. :-) Nice shot - good luck in the challenge. 9', '2005-10-28 21:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
