(1821976, 248943, 41675, '<td valign="top">I generally like simple compositions such as yours, but for me there is just a bit too much white space here. Also, I find the choice of black for the border a bit overwhelming and takes away from the photo''s softness for me. I wonder how the border would look if you chose the purple color from the flower?</td>', 'I generally like simple compositions such as yours, but for me there is just a bit too much white space here. Also, I find the choice of black for the border a bit overwhelming and takes away from the photo''s softness for me. I wonder how the border would look if you chose the purple color from the flower?', '2005-10-28 21:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
