(1822808, 248285, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like that I have to study it but it''s so faint (I''m sure that was your point) that it loses impact. It has a pink tinge to it on my monitor. It could have worked with a bit more contrast.</td>', 'I like that I have to study it but it''s so faint (I''m sure that was your point) that it loses impact. It has a pink tinge to it on my monitor. It could have worked with a bit more contrast.', '2005-10-29 10:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822809, 248963, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is very pretty and "soft." It''s like she just collapsed on the bed in pure joy. It has a casual sense to it which I like. The bouquet and the petals around her add a nice bit of eye candy. Some may say that it''s too much darker color to truly be light, but with her dress and the lace on her wrists, I think it still works.</td>', 'This is very pretty and "soft." It''s like she just collapsed on the bed in pure joy. It has a casual sense to it which I like. The bouquet and the petals around her add a nice bit of eye candy. Some may say that it''s too much darker color to truly be light, but with her dress and the lace on her wrists, I think it still works.', '2005-10-29 10:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822811, 248766, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great focus and detail. I like the shadowing below the feather.  It seems a bit too centered to my eye. I am a big fan of more negative space on one side, utilizing the rule of thirds..</td>', 'Great focus and detail. I like the shadowing below the feather.  It seems a bit too centered to my eye. I am a big fan of more negative space on one side, utilizing the rule of thirds..', '2005-10-29 10:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
