(1828268, 249617, 46999, '<td valign="top">I think that this picture has great potential, however the very first thing that grabs my eye is the small black speck to the left of the shaft.  I hate to be so nitpicky, but I can not keep my eye from going to that spot no matter how much I try to focus on the rest of the otherwise beautiful picture.</td>', 'I think that this picture has great potential, however the very first thing that grabs my eye is the small black speck to the left of the shaft.  I hate to be so nitpicky, but I can not keep my eye from going to that spot no matter how much I try to focus on the rest of the otherwise beautiful picture.', '2005-10-31 20:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1828273, 247597, 46999, '<td valign="top">This adorable picture could be titled "gosh, how many times am I going to be picked up and put back in this spot before I am allowed to go out and play?"  It looks like the tail end of a long day of shooting for the little kitten. . . though anything over 15 seconds is a long day for a kitten.</td>', 'This adorable picture could be titled "gosh, how many times am I going to be picked up and put back in this spot before I am allowed to go out and play?"  It looks like the tail end of a long day of shooting for the little kitten. . . though anything over 15 seconds is a long day for a kitten.', '2005-10-31 20:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1828277, 249583, 8367, '<td valign="top">Nice detail captured. Compositionally, I''d rather see this with the candle in the lower right or at least a bit more space above the flame.</td>', 'Nice detail captured. Compositionally, I''d rather see this with the candle in the lower right or at least a bit more space above the flame.', '2005-10-31 20:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
