(1828297, 249610, 46999, '<td valign="top">I think that the only problem is that it is a bit too washed out.  While it is an interesting effect that the rabbit blends seamlessly into the background, more would be gained if there were more texture and detail in the rabbits white fur.</td>', 'I think that the only problem is that it is a bit too washed out.  While it is an interesting effect that the rabbit blends seamlessly into the background, more would be gained if there were more texture and detail in the rabbits white fur.', '2005-10-31 20:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
