(1830641, 246917, 16488, '<td valign="top">What a fun image! Bright and sassy! <br/>Wish the edges of the glass were just a little more "there"--hard to do under basic editing when you''re fighting litlle blotches of sensor dust, though. Sweet composition, nicely done.</td>', 'What a fun image! Bright and sassy! Wish the edges of the glass were just a little more "there"--hard to do under basic editing when you''re fighting litlle blotches of sensor dust, though. Sweet composition, nicely done.', '2005-11-01 17:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
