(1830673, 248860, 10634, '<td valign="top">Wow... what a cutie. Look at those bright blue eyes. Her papa''s gonna be beating the boys off with a stick  when she gets older. Would have liked to see her whole chin, though. Good Luck</td>', 'Wow... what a cutie. Look at those bright blue eyes. Her papa''s gonna be beating the boys off with a stick  when she gets older. Would have liked to see her whole chin, though. Good Luck', '2005-11-01 18:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
