(1830694, 249461, 10634, '<td valign="top">Your subject is certainly a light color and your background may have been white, but your  lighting makes it difficult to see. It also looks as though it is a black and white which doesn''t help bring out the white in this shot.</td>', 'Your subject is certainly a light color and your background may have been white, but your  lighting makes it difficult to see. It also looks as though it is a black and white which doesn''t help bring out the white in this shot.', '2005-11-01 18:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
