(1831571, 248438, 42135, '<td valign="top">Just a follow up for those interested. This was my 2nd challenge here and I am so happy with the results. Ice is 8 yrs old, the blue cast came from me trying to boost her white in order to get the yellow cast out of her aged fur adjusting hue/saturation/brightness .. I did find a better way thanks to the comments I received here!  Ice has a gold and blue eye and is VERY deaf .. which makes her extra special and spoiled. Thank you all for your comments, votes and help, they are truly appreciated.</td>', 'Just a follow up for those interested. This was my 2nd challenge here and I am so happy with the results. Ice is 8 yrs old, the blue cast came from me trying to boost her white in order to get the yellow cast out of her aged fur adjusting hue/saturation/brightness .. I did find a better way thanks to the comments I received here!  Ice has a gold and blue eye and is VERY deaf .. which makes her extra special and spoiled. Thank you all for your comments, votes and help, they are truly appreciated.', '2005-11-02 00:24:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(1831572, 249577, 22734, '<td valign="top">This image pulls the strings of the heart. Congratulations on your YELLOW!</td>', 'This image pulls the strings of the heart. Congratulations on your YELLOW!', '2005-11-02 00:25:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(1831574, 249577, 41845, '<td valign="top">Tony Congrats on your first ribbon.  This was an adorable entry.  So what are you gonna do with the chick now?</td>', 'Tony Congrats on your first ribbon.  This was an adorable entry.  So what are you gonna do with the chick now?', '2005-11-02 00:25:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(1831575, 249478, 32084, '<td valign="top">I didn''t leave a comment before, but I rated this one of the highest in the challenge.  This was very nicely done.  The white of the birds was nicely shot without being too hot and blown out.  In fact that is why I feel it is such a nice job.  While the top 25% is a great result, personally I feel you deserved to fall in the top 10% with this shot.  Well done.</td>', 'I didn''t leave a comment before, but I rated this one of the highest in the challenge.  This was very nicely done.  The white of the birds was nicely shot without being too hot and blown out.  In fact that is why I feel it is such a nice job.  While the top 25% is a great result, personally I feel you deserved to fall in the top 10% with this shot.  Well done.', '2005-11-02 00:25:50.000000', NULL, 0),
