(1831775, 249478, 19936, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all for the comments, all are constructive. I guess I should have left a little more color in the shot and kept the contrast up.  But then again I kinda of liked the cool feel to this.</td>', 'Thanks to all for the comments, all are constructive. I guess I should have left a little more color in the shot and kept the contrast up.  But then again I kinda of liked the cool feel to this.', '2005-11-02 01:16:18.000000', NULL, 0),
