(1831854, 248223, 37893, '<td valign="top">I missed this one during the challenge Marc. I think this one is a good study yet somehow I wish the DOF was smaller to have evrything in focus. It seems like the WB is a bit off in this image but nothing to really distract the viewers attention. Great placement and good score overall!</td>', 'I missed this one during the challenge Marc. I think this one is a good study yet somehow I wish the DOF was smaller to have evrything in focus. It seems like the WB is a bit off in this image but nothing to really distract the viewers attention. Great placement and good score overall!', '2005-11-02 01:42:10.000000', NULL, 0),
