(1832001, 248909, 17507, '<td valign="top">I must say I think this was vastly underappreciated. Can''t say I''m surprised, as anything that takes more than two seconds to "get" usually gets... well... overlooked. So it goes. Your score is no reflection of the quality of this image.</td>', 'I must say I think this was vastly underappreciated. Can''t say I''m surprised, as anything that takes more than two seconds to "get" usually gets... well... overlooked. So it goes. Your score is no reflection of the quality of this image.', '2005-11-02 02:51:45.000000', NULL, 0),
