(1832029, 247485, 43546, '<td valign="top">Thanks to those who have managed to view my photo with higher res monitor bcos unintentionally i could see the patchy noise on the upper left which may appear to those who has a lower res display... i will repost here again when i got home tonight to show u my intended entry... with just all white and the blue, no patchy yellow on the top left... too bad, i thought this time i will get a higher rating if not for my mistake... thats the problem with a white background, must b careful next time ;-) Lesson learnt!<br/></td>', 'Thanks to those who have managed to view my photo with higher res monitor bcos unintentionally i could see the patchy noise on the upper left which may appear to those who has a lower res display... i will repost here again when i got home tonight to show u my intended entry... with just all white and the blue, no patchy yellow on the top left... too bad, i thought this time i will get a higher rating if not for my mistake... thats the problem with a white background, must b careful next time ;-) Lesson learnt!', '2005-11-02 03:13:46.000000', NULL, 0),
