(1832537, 249514, 40580, '<td valign="top">Thanks all for the comments and score.  As someone (and my wife later pointed out), it''s actually a mortar and pestle.<br/> <br/>There were a few different versions.  It was either dark with detail or light lacking the detail.  That''s why it looks soft.  It was actually taken at f8, so it shouldn''t be soft.<br/> <br/>Thanks again.</td>', 'Thanks all for the comments and score.  As someone (and my wife later pointed out), it''s actually a mortar and pestle. There were a few different versions.  It was either dark with detail or light lacking the detail.  That''s why it looks soft.  It was actually taken at f8, so it shouldn''t be soft. Thanks again.', '2005-11-02 09:38:11.000000', NULL, 0),
