(1834121, 249548, 25397, '<td valign="top">Bahahahahahahahhahahha<br/>A Clockwork Orange meets Team America</td>', 'BahahahahahahahhahahhaA Clockwork Orange meets Team America', '2005-11-02 17:36:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(1834132, 247527, 15711, '<td valign="top">I didn''t give this a very high score during the challenge as it doesn''t hold much interest.  Cutesy figurines don''t do well in a photographic setting, to me at least. There isn''t any artful sense to them and they are already "art" in their own rite.  If you choose to do something like this again, I''d make sure that the subject is tack sharp and has some presence in the shot, not just lying there with no forethought. Sitting upright with lots of negative space around might''ve given them the punch you were hoping for.<br/> <br/>Hope you find this helpful. ;~D</td>', 'I didn''t give this a very high score during the challenge as it doesn''t hold much interest.  Cutesy figurines don''t do well in a photographic setting, to me at least. There isn''t any artful sense to them and they are already "art" in their own rite.  If you choose to do something like this again, I''d make sure that the subject is tack sharp and has some presence in the shot, not just lying there with no forethought. Sitting upright with lots of negative space around might''ve given them the punch you were hoping for. Hope you find this helpful. ;~D', '2005-11-02 17:42:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(1834169, 249548, 35357, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Joey Lawrence:</b></div><hr/><i> Bahahahahahahahhahahha<br/>A Clockwork Orange meets Team America </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Heh, I just watched Team America a couple weeks ago on the movie network.  My brother-in-law said they must''ve cut some scenes in the theatre version (a couple of parts in the sex scene RE urine &amp; feces).  I was in pain!  Been decades since I saw A Clockwork Orange.</td>', 'Originally posted by Joey Lawrence: BahahahahahahahhahahhaA Clockwork Orange meets Team America  Heh, I just watched Team America a couple weeks ago on the movie network.  My brother-in-law said they must''ve cut some scenes in the theatre version (a couple of parts in the sex scene RE urine & feces).  I was in pain!  Been decades since I saw A Clockwork Orange.', '2005-11-02 17:59:56.000000', NULL, 0),
