(1894608, 248964, 37893, '<td valign="top">Here''s my take on this image (of course take it for what it is). The "Cute" photo is a bit soft. The eyes are amazingly rich and wonderfully rendered. While the aim of this challenge is to provide a Light on White, I think you''ve exceeded it just a tad and as a result, had almost blown out some finer details. I think if you used curves then this image would pop. As it is, it''s simple and meets the challenge. I would probably just prefer a bit more DOF.</td>', 'Here''s my take on this image (of course take it for what it is). The "Cute" photo is a bit soft. The eyes are amazingly rich and wonderfully rendered. While the aim of this challenge is to provide a Light on White, I think you''ve exceeded it just a tad and as a result, had almost blown out some finer details. I think if you used curves then this image would pop. As it is, it''s simple and meets the challenge. I would probably just prefer a bit more DOF.', '2005-11-24 01:34:34.000000', NULL, 0),
