(2006867, 247402, 37961, '<td valign="top">I''m not a big flower photography connissuer (sp) but when I see one I like I try to comment on it. This shot is really pretty, I think what sets it apart from alot of them is the slightly overexposed lighting. The color is muted, yet bright at the same time. Very unusual &amp; artistic.</td>', 'I''m not a big flower photography connissuer (sp) but when I see one I like I try to comment on it. This shot is really pretty, I think what sets it apart from alot of them is the slightly overexposed lighting. The color is muted, yet bright at the same time. Very unusual & artistic.', '2006-01-05 11:58:22.000000', NULL, 0),
